Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Restores PowerToys PowerRename's legacy IContextMenu (shellex) registration.
; Only needed if you removed it to de-duplicate the classic context menu and
; want the old entry back. The packaged IExplorerCommand registration lives in
; the MSIX package and is unaffected by this file.

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Classes\Directory\Background\shellex\ContextMenuHandlers\PowerRenameExt]
@="{0440049F-D1DC-4E46-B27B-98393D79486B}"

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Classes\AllFileSystemObjects\shellex\ContextMenuHandlers\PowerRenameExt]
@="{0440049F-D1DC-4E46-B27B-98393D79486B}"
